  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, Luis speaking. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I got a parking ticket and I want to contest it. How do I go about that, and what does the hearing look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Do you have the ticket in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I've got it here. It was Saturday, during the snow, down on Thames by the, um, the old [line breaks up] sorry, I'm on speakerphone. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little choppy, but I've got you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. It says I was in a snow emergency spot, but I swear the sign was buried. Reminds me, back in the nineties we had a blizzard and my dad dug out the whole street for, uh, sorry. Anyway. The hearing. How does that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:41:53-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You'd request a hearing on the ticket, in writing or in person, depending on what's printed on it. Then they schedule you, you tell the hearing officer your side, and they decide. Bring any photos you took of the sign."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Can I get the photo of the violation emailed to me? The one the officer took?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If there's one on file, yes. What's the ticket number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, let me find it. [pause] Okay, it's 4471882."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 4471882. And the email you'd like it sent to?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can use the one on file, I think. Or I can call back with it. My number is 401-555-0179 if you need that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note the number. I'll put in the request and someone will send the photo along. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Sorry, I'm a little scattered. I'm actually rehearsing what to say to my in-laws at dinner tonight, so my head's somewhere else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:42:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the hearing officer is probably an easier audience. Good luck tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:43:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, thanks. Thanks for your help."
    }
  ],
